    "body": "# Bug report\n\n### Bug description:\n\n```python\nimport io\n\nclass MockRawIO:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.closed = NotImplemented\n    def write(self, b):\n        return len(data)\n    def writable(self):\n        return True\n\ntp = io.BufferedWriter\nwriter = MockRawIO()\nbufio = tp(writer, 8)\nbufio.close()\n```\n\n```\nSystemError: <method 'close' of '_io.BufferedWriter' objects> returned a result with an exception set\n```\n\n\n### CPython versions tested on:\n\nCPython main branch\n\n### Operating systems tested on:\n\nLinux\n\n<!-- gh-linked-prs -->\n### Linked PRs\n* gh-140653\n<!-- /gh-linked-prs -->\n",
