      "body": "Bisected to db68bfc771e6a85573732e0b579e8f68841c9b5c. In 3.14, the behavior is emitting a catchable `TypeError`, but on main it crashes. I believe the problem is the sign of `buffered_closed` is lost in the `IS_CLOSED` macro.",
